WEBVTT

00:00:02.336 --> 00:00:08.969
Dying a child

00:00:09.510 --> 00:00:10.787
Dying a child

00:00:10.811 --> 00:00:15.291
Oh, Kiss me deadly

00:00:15.315 --> 00:00:19.662
<i>Kiss me, kill me, love me</i>

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:24.100
Oh, Kiss me deadly

00:00:24.124 --> 00:00:28.618
<i>Kiss me, kill me, love me</i>

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:34.744
Dying a child

00:00:34.768 --> 00:00:41.674
Oh, Child prey

00:00:43.610 --> 00:00:50.209
Oh, Child prey

00:00:52.352 --> 00:01:00.352
Hurry and May

00:01:01.061 --> 00:01:03.239
The reasons why one can't
laugh from the heart

00:01:03.263 --> 00:01:05.408
It's a simple reason... that's life

00:01:05.432 --> 00:01:09.946
Oh, Kiss me deadly

00:01:09.970 --> 00:01:14.184
<i>Kiss me, kill me, love me</i>

00:01:14.208 --> 00:01:18.788
Oh, Kiss me deadly

00:01:18.812 --> 00:01:22.926
<i>Kiss me, kill me, love me</i>

00:01:22.950 --> 00:01:27.464
Oh, Kiss me deadly

00:01:27.488 --> 00:01:33.336
<i>Kiss me, kill me, love me</i>

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:38.274
Child is burning

00:01:38.298 --> 00:01:42.257
Oh, Kiss me deadly

00:01:46.473 --> 00:01:50.410
Nice job, Yuri... Now, on to
the next program, I think.

00:01:53.280 --> 00:01:55.374
Now, who is that young lad?

00:02:11.932 --> 00:02:14.924
Yuri Chakovsky, if I'm not mistaken.

00:02:17.938 --> 00:02:20.339
Think you can go a few more rounds?

00:02:30.184 --> 00:02:33.329
Wait up... Do you have any
idea what you're doing?

00:02:33.353 --> 00:02:34.998
The guy is the welterweight champ--

00:02:35.022 --> 00:02:38.067
Champion, right...
That's exactly what I'm looking for...

00:02:38.091 --> 00:02:41.789
Hey, pal, I hear you're a little
short on sparring partners.

00:02:44.331 --> 00:02:49.078
That was some great work, kid. But come
back in five years when you've sprouted.

00:02:49.102 --> 00:02:53.164
Now, Yuri, we still have one
more program to finish up today.

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:03.893
Yuri, stop staring... You're wasting time.

00:03:03.917 --> 00:03:05.828
Give that boy some gloves.

00:03:05.852 --> 00:03:08.048
Let's see what he's made of.

00:03:10.691 --> 00:03:14.938
What is this? That kid's not gonna
help you. He's a one punch knock-out...

00:03:14.962 --> 00:03:16.673
You are the world champion!

00:03:16.697 --> 00:03:18.341
Vladimir...

00:03:18.365 --> 00:03:21.744
Above everything else,
I am always Xigil...

00:03:21.768 --> 00:03:23.947
Never in rich history of Xigil

00:03:23.971 --> 00:03:26.616
has anyone ever turned
down a fighting challenge.

00:03:26.640 --> 00:03:29.252
Not even if it meant
fighting an entire nation.

00:03:29.276 --> 00:03:32.255
Not even if it meant fighting
women and children...

00:03:32.279 --> 00:03:35.271
It is time for that kid
to strap on gloves.

00:03:36.984 --> 00:03:38.428
What's Xigil?

00:03:38.452 --> 00:03:41.731
They were the strongest
Nomads in Mongol history.

00:03:41.755 --> 00:03:44.801
Even the legendary
Genghis Khan feared them...

00:03:44.825 --> 00:03:47.453
So, are you sure you
wanna get into this?

00:03:50.330 --> 00:03:54.392
You're fighting a child, Yuri...
I simply cannot permit this!

00:03:56.003 --> 00:03:59.582
I think you hit... my pancreas.

00:03:59.606 --> 00:04:01.574
So, are you ready for this?

00:04:03.477 --> 00:04:05.655
Just say the word, champ.

00:04:05.679 --> 00:04:07.323
What's your name, boy?

00:04:07.347 --> 00:04:10.647
Baki. Baki Hanma.
And don't call me boy.

00:04:11.118 --> 00:04:12.662
Are you sure you're ready...

00:04:12.686 --> 00:04:15.231
...Warrior Baki?

00:04:15.255 --> 00:04:18.225
I never thought I'd actually
fight a world champion--

00:04:26.900 --> 00:04:29.212
Man, Yuri's not messing around.

00:04:29.236 --> 00:04:30.680
Yuri, he's gonna die!

00:04:30.704 --> 00:04:32.035
Don't move!

00:04:33.874 --> 00:04:36.352
No one is allowed to
enter into this ring

00:04:36.376 --> 00:04:39.555
until Japanese warrior
has admitted his defeat.

00:04:39.579 --> 00:04:42.241
He asked for everything he's getting.

00:04:55.228 --> 00:04:57.925
Finally found someone
who could throw a punch.

00:05:00.133 --> 00:05:03.433
What are you waiting for?
I didn't say I was finished.

00:05:19.853 --> 00:05:21.230
What are we doing here?

00:05:21.254 --> 00:05:22.432
Going inside.

00:05:22.456 --> 00:05:27.758
Inside? I requested an audience with
the new head of Hanayama Industries.

00:05:29.529 --> 00:05:33.509
Kuriyagawa... I am quite aware of
how full of it you thought I was

00:05:33.533 --> 00:05:36.979
when I told you that our new boss
is only fifteen years old...

00:05:37.003 --> 00:05:39.482
I'm hoping that when you do get
to meet him in a few moments,

00:05:39.506 --> 00:05:42.373
you'll realize that I am no liar.

00:05:43.844 --> 00:05:46.789
Everything is undergoing a great
deal of change these days.

00:05:46.813 --> 00:05:49.359
Rifts between different
organizations have even changed.

00:05:49.383 --> 00:05:50.860
It used to be all group battles,

00:05:50.884 --> 00:05:53.396
but the latest gig is to
get one rep from your side

00:05:53.420 --> 00:05:55.965
to fight the one rep from their side.

00:05:55.989 --> 00:05:57.900
So, you're saying that your leader--

00:05:57.924 --> 00:05:58.968
Will be here shortly.

00:05:58.992 --> 00:06:03.225
Our boss is our representative in
this battle. He needs to be here.

00:06:12.672 --> 00:06:15.218
What took you girls so long?

00:06:15.242 --> 00:06:19.255
My representative here got so
bored he started punching the air.

00:06:19.279 --> 00:06:21.324
Representative?

00:06:21.348 --> 00:06:22.992
I recognize him from somewhere.

00:06:23.016 --> 00:06:24.494
'Course you do.

00:06:24.518 --> 00:06:26.829
He's a former professional.

00:06:26.853 --> 00:06:32.135
Yajima... We have rules that clearly state
one rep fights another and that's that.

00:06:32.159 --> 00:06:34.537
Easy, slick, there's no
need to yell about it.

00:06:34.561 --> 00:06:37.407
Tommy here has been in my
employment since yesterday...

00:06:37.431 --> 00:06:39.776
'Course, I'm gonna have
to fire him tomorrow.

00:06:39.800 --> 00:06:43.464
A member is a member even if
it's just for three days, right?

00:06:44.504 --> 00:06:48.532
It's called using your brain...
You should try it.

00:07:11.331 --> 00:07:14.266
<i>It's Yajima...
He's brought in some punk kid.</i>

00:07:18.004 --> 00:07:21.818
<i>That's him? Fifteen year
old Kaoru Hanayama...</i>

00:07:21.842 --> 00:07:26.622
Kaoru, just who I'm looking for. You know
we had some trouble with your guys.

00:07:26.646 --> 00:07:28.671
Perhaps we can settle it here.

00:07:30.083 --> 00:07:35.031
We'll just play a quick game of cards,
and you know what... You can go first.

00:07:35.055 --> 00:07:36.921
Don't do it, Yajima.

00:07:38.325 --> 00:07:42.319
Hey, those are mine. You can't
have 'em! What are you doing?!

00:07:47.334 --> 00:07:48.611
Boss!

00:07:48.635 --> 00:07:50.729
Man, he knocked out some teeth!

00:07:55.308 --> 00:08:00.678
To do this to a deck of cards, he must be
stronger than any man I've ever known.

00:08:01.948 --> 00:08:03.882
Tear that guy apart!

00:08:09.856 --> 00:08:14.521
What the-? He's getting pummeled!
Why doesn't he even bother to fight back?

00:08:17.664 --> 00:08:19.996
He's just biding his time.

00:08:28.675 --> 00:08:30.453
He might be slower than other fighters,

00:08:30.477 --> 00:08:33.811
but the power behind his
blows is almost unimaginable.

00:08:37.183 --> 00:08:39.208
He shattered his arm...

00:09:13.119 --> 00:09:17.317
You're managing well, but you're
still a far cry from beating me.

00:09:26.633 --> 00:09:28.177
He stood his ground?!

00:09:28.201 --> 00:09:30.499
What is this kid made of?

00:09:33.540 --> 00:09:34.507
Move now.

00:09:36.543 --> 00:09:37.553
No way!

00:09:37.577 --> 00:09:39.067
He dodged it!

00:09:40.013 --> 00:09:44.382
Move! If you wanna stay on your feet
then you can't stay still for a second!

00:09:55.462 --> 00:09:56.361
Stop it!

00:10:01.201 --> 00:10:03.932
<i>You have earned your title of warrior.</i>

00:10:04.971 --> 00:10:09.151
But I have always achieved victory
by my ability to read my enemy.

00:10:09.175 --> 00:10:11.405
Ever since that one day...

00:10:14.214 --> 00:10:15.943
Yuri, I'm scared!

00:10:18.652 --> 00:10:21.087
Everything will be fine, Nina.

00:10:23.223 --> 00:10:26.302
I've just got to do a little more hunting.

00:10:26.326 --> 00:10:29.805
Twenty-three, twenty-four. Now, read.

00:10:29.829 --> 00:10:35.165
Read them. Read the enemy's breathing,
their bloodlust, their power.

00:10:40.440 --> 00:10:44.001
Nina... Whatever you do,
don't leave my side!

00:10:46.613 --> 00:10:51.210
<i>I can win! I know I can!
I'm more powerful than all of them!</i>

00:10:58.625 --> 00:11:00.616
I did it, Nina.

00:11:03.930 --> 00:11:07.332
Now, we'll all have meat
for rest of winter.

00:11:11.304 --> 00:11:14.535
Read the enemy... Do so...

00:11:17.944 --> 00:11:20.538
...and all becomes clear.

00:11:37.197 --> 00:11:41.532
Read the enemy. Do so,
and all becomes clear.

00:12:04.324 --> 00:12:05.814
He's out cold.

00:12:06.025 --> 00:12:08.337
Someone get the stretcher!

00:12:08.361 --> 00:12:12.708
You gave that kid a worse beating
than Dinoy before him. But why, Yuri?

00:12:12.732 --> 00:12:15.224
My courtesy as warrior.

00:12:20.173 --> 00:12:23.939
It's what he wanted...
This warrior, Baki.

00:12:26.713 --> 00:12:31.260
So... Kaoru Hanayama. Sounds very cute.

00:12:31.284 --> 00:12:36.398
You should see him. He is definitely one
of the strongest fighters I've ever seen,

00:12:36.422 --> 00:12:39.289
and he's only fifteen years old.

00:12:39.926 --> 00:12:42.705
He's too young to be
considered a real gangster,

00:12:42.729 --> 00:12:46.809
but he might be a
fantastic match for Baki.

00:12:46.833 --> 00:12:49.745
He's a Super A-Rank Total Fighter.

00:12:49.769 --> 00:12:53.983
We would be wasting him if he fought
any old roughneck on the street.

00:12:54.007 --> 00:12:58.087
Kaoru's greatest strength is
in his restrained power...

00:12:58.111 --> 00:13:02.858
<i>1 witnessed this myself.
He's patient while he coils up inside.</i>

00:13:02.882 --> 00:13:04.577
Restrained power?

00:13:06.152 --> 00:13:09.498
He sounds neat... I like him.

00:13:09.522 --> 00:13:11.300
Put him up against Baki.

00:13:11.324 --> 00:13:12.758
Understood.

00:13:19.399 --> 00:13:23.145
A mother who demands her own
son fight a vicious gangster...

00:13:23.169 --> 00:13:26.015
<i>If only all mothers were as loving.</i>

00:13:26.039 --> 00:13:27.871
The world would he better.

00:13:30.543 --> 00:13:33.689
Write down whatever
amount you think is fair.

00:13:33.713 --> 00:13:36.659
Naturally, this isn't
a personal request...

00:13:36.683 --> 00:13:40.362
This comes from the highest
levels at the Akezawa Group.

00:13:40.386 --> 00:13:42.798
From Emi Akezawa, you mean.

00:13:42.822 --> 00:13:45.935
The inheritor of the
multi-trillion dollar Akezawa Group-

00:13:45.959 --> 00:13:48.437
not to mention raging golddigger.

00:13:48.461 --> 00:13:52.641
Why does a crank like her need
the skills of a yakuza boss?

00:13:52.665 --> 00:13:55.644
Please keep your
unpleasantries to a minimum.

00:13:55.668 --> 00:13:59.248
Yeah, anyway. What does
she want the boss for?

00:13:59.272 --> 00:14:03.485
Ms. Akezawa wishes him to
battle a certain fighter.

00:14:03.509 --> 00:14:06.342
He is just a boy of thirteen, but...

00:14:07.247 --> 00:14:12.228
Kuriyagawa, I think you should
stop your mouth right there.

00:14:12.252 --> 00:14:15.831
Our boss is proud and would
never stoop so low...

00:14:15.855 --> 00:14:19.068
In fact, I think we should forget
this conversation ever happened...

00:14:19.092 --> 00:14:23.672
As if you, of all people, are ignorant
of how taboo the name of your employer

00:14:23.696 --> 00:14:26.631
has become among the gangs in this town.

00:14:27.033 --> 00:14:28.967
I understand.

00:14:31.170 --> 00:14:32.081
You rotten--

00:14:32.105 --> 00:14:33.766
Sir, no!

00:14:35.708 --> 00:14:38.220
Mr. Hanayama, I realize
this is rude of me,

00:14:38.244 --> 00:14:41.270
but I am not here today as
a mear child's messenger.

00:14:42.715 --> 00:14:45.294
You are clearly no
average fifteen year old,

00:14:45.318 --> 00:14:48.464
and our fighter is no
average thirteen year old.

00:14:48.488 --> 00:14:51.834
I'm sure you've known many children
who have been channeled into

00:14:51.858 --> 00:14:54.303
some type of fast-track lifestyle...

00:14:54.327 --> 00:14:59.208
Spending every waking hour of every day
studying for test after test, perhaps.

00:14:59.232 --> 00:15:01.443
This boy has the same story.

00:15:01.467 --> 00:15:03.979
He has been channeled into the
hands of the best equipment

00:15:04.003 --> 00:15:07.735
and the greatest coaches in
all manners of training.

00:15:08.007 --> 00:15:11.587
And with the best coaches, the best
training, and the best environments,

00:15:11.611 --> 00:15:16.191
he might be a boy in age--
But he is a warrior in mind and body.

00:15:16.215 --> 00:15:21.210
Just the other day he took on one hundred
men and knocked out thirty-seven of them.

00:15:23.156 --> 00:15:24.533
Wait!

00:15:24.557 --> 00:15:28.671
I know that you see a boy as just a boy,
no matter his strength, but this boy--

00:15:28.695 --> 00:15:29.805
Shut up!

00:15:29.829 --> 00:15:31.307
Not yet.

00:15:31.331 --> 00:15:34.677
Kaoru, as long as you are known as
the strongest fighter in town...

00:15:34.701 --> 00:15:37.046
There is one thing you can never avoid...

00:15:37.070 --> 00:15:39.266
The shadow of Yujiro Hanma.

00:15:43.476 --> 00:15:46.655
It seems that a simple
name can be quite a shock.

00:15:46.679 --> 00:15:51.260
We're not idiots... He's the most
famous fighter our kind has ever seen.

00:15:51.284 --> 00:15:54.897
Many consider him to be the
strongest being on the planet.

00:15:54.921 --> 00:15:56.899
Only those who believe in brute force

00:15:56.923 --> 00:16:00.135
would ever hold the Hanma
name in such high regards...

00:16:00.159 --> 00:16:04.858
Yujiro Hanma is the father of
the boy we wish you to fight.

00:16:12.338 --> 00:16:13.806
He's coming to.

00:16:16.676 --> 00:16:18.405
So, how you feeling?

00:16:21.347 --> 00:16:22.781
Oh, man...

00:16:24.450 --> 00:16:26.929
So... where did Yuri go?

00:16:26.953 --> 00:16:28.530
He's long gone.

00:16:28.554 --> 00:16:32.684
He was worried about you after the fight...
but he said he couldn't stay any longer.

00:16:37.964 --> 00:16:39.441
What's wrong with you?

00:16:39.465 --> 00:16:42.945
Come on, you're not gonna start crying
like a little girl, are you, man?

00:16:42.969 --> 00:16:47.031
Let it go... You fought the world
champ and didn't even get killed.

00:16:47.740 --> 00:16:49.618
You don't know anything!!

00:16:49.642 --> 00:16:53.272
I've never, ever lost
a fight to anyone!!

00:17:19.539 --> 00:17:21.633
Pick up your butts, would you?

00:17:24.677 --> 00:17:28.590
Where have you been,
coming home this time of night?

00:17:28.614 --> 00:17:30.692
What does it matter to you?

00:17:30.716 --> 00:17:33.796
Something about last nights brawl
doesn't sit right with me...

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:36.398
Guys who'd normally jump at
the chance to kill each other

00:17:36.422 --> 00:17:39.983
and they all side to
fight you. Why is that?

00:17:54.807 --> 00:17:56.418
Oh, great. Mom.

00:17:56.442 --> 00:17:58.501
Holy crap! That's your mom?

00:18:13.826 --> 00:18:16.227
I've decided to quit my training.

00:18:17.797 --> 00:18:20.676
I want to do things my way from now on...

00:18:20.700 --> 00:18:23.145
So go ahead and tell me
how stupid I'm being...

00:18:23.169 --> 00:18:25.763
How I can't be the best without
you and you trainers...

00:18:36.716 --> 00:18:39.447
Grow strong, Baki. I know that you can.

00:18:44.457 --> 00:18:47.256
Grow strong like your father before you.

00:19:01.474 --> 00:19:03.636
He's just like his father.

00:19:11.851 --> 00:19:14.763
<i>| understand most thirteen
year olds, you know...</i>

00:19:14.787 --> 00:19:17.766
I've been in this business a long time.

00:19:17.790 --> 00:19:22.271
There are those guys out there who are
eager to hurt you while others watch it.

00:19:22.295 --> 00:19:26.341
Those are the easy ones... Those are the
guys using violence instead of words.

00:19:26.365 --> 00:19:27.560
It's classic.

00:19:30.469 --> 00:19:34.929
But not with you, kid...
It's not about the scars.

00:19:40.880 --> 00:19:43.258
You're not making me a snack, are you?

00:19:43.282 --> 00:19:46.946
I'm just cooking the water
out so it won't spoil.

00:19:47.820 --> 00:19:52.768
I just don't get you...
You're so serious all the time.

00:19:52.792 --> 00:19:55.170
No one's asking you to stick around.

00:19:55.194 --> 00:19:57.993
I'm having some trouble with the missus.

00:19:59.065 --> 00:20:02.365
Yeah... You're lucky
having such a cool mother.

00:20:02.969 --> 00:20:06.667
She really seems to support you.

00:20:08.574 --> 00:20:12.033
You ever thought of living with
her instead of by yourself?

00:20:32.131 --> 00:20:34.259
I'll never win in this state.

00:20:35.868 --> 00:20:38.633
Power, speed, and technique.

00:20:39.238 --> 00:20:44.039
I have to start all of my training over
from square one or I'll never beat him!

00:20:46.379 --> 00:20:48.074
Packed and ready.

00:21:01.627 --> 00:21:04.072
All right... Maybe I overpacked.

00:21:04.096 --> 00:21:06.997
No way... It'll be good for me.

00:21:16.976 --> 00:21:20.412
"Going to the mountains to train. -Baki
P.S. Pick up your cigarette butts.”

00:21:22.982 --> 00:21:25.927
Ninety wins in a row
and still going strong!

00:21:25.951 --> 00:21:30.966
The granite-fisted Julio Quevas has
finally touched down here at the airport.

00:21:30.990 --> 00:21:35.170
The entire world has waited breathlessly
for his clash with Yuri Chakovsky.

00:21:35.194 --> 00:21:39.131
In just one short month, this fight
of legends will become a reality!

00:21:44.236 --> 00:21:46.500
Oh, uh...

00:21:48.107 --> 00:21:50.085
Kitazawa, I presume.

00:21:50.109 --> 00:21:52.976
We need to ask you about Baki.

00:22:44.397 --> 00:22:49.945
The hazy afternoon in the winter sun

00:22:49.969 --> 00:22:55.550
<i>hangs onto love in one
corner of the pavement</i>

00:22:55.574 --> 00:23:01.223
When I blew on my cold hands

00:23:01.247 --> 00:23:06.228
a tiny bit of courage swelled up.

00:23:06.252 --> 00:23:11.833
Today will certainly be wonderful,

00:23:11.857 --> 00:23:17.372
<i>gently enveloped in love</i>

00:23:17.396 --> 00:23:23.044
There are some strange feelings too,

00:23:23.068 --> 00:23:28.583
but they will be reborn

00:23:28.607 --> 00:23:34.256
Today will certainly be wonderful;

00:23:34.280 --> 00:23:40.219
they will be reborn as even more love.

00:23:54.366 --> 00:23:56.611
<i>He fought and lost in the last episode,</i>

00:23:56.635 --> 00:24:00.582
but defeat has only ignited this
boy's fighting spirit even further.

00:24:00.606 --> 00:24:04.352
In his unending quest for a great
opponent, he challenges a monster

00:24:04.376 --> 00:24:07.656
that stirs only in the
darkest pitch of night.

00:24:07.680 --> 00:24:11.993
And Baht's touch on reality slips
into that all too familiar place

00:24:12.017 --> 00:24:14.748
in ail of us that we refuse to go.
